<http://data.silknow.org/object/18bfda54-3eaf-3a75-ac74-9794e6d5cb94/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Pair of mittens of black silk velvet, embroidered with silver filé over parchment. There is a narrow repeating border all round of scroll and leaf ornament. The peak is faced with black velvet, with a floral motif worked on both sides.  The rest of each mitten is lined with ivory silk taffeta. There are no openings or parts for thumbs.\n\nThe side seam of each mitten has been unpicked"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/18bfda54-3eaf-3a75-ac74-9794e6d5cb94> .

<http://data.silknow.org/object/18bfda54-3eaf-3a75-ac74-9794e6d5cb94>
